// Post-lab revision — NOT the version run in the screenshots (that one is
// final_anomaly_detection.kql). Two changes I would make before running this
// continuously as a scheduled rule:
//   1. Time-scope first: 'where Timestamp > ago(2h)' limits the scan window,
//      which matters once the table grows past a demo dataset.
//   2. arg_max(Delay, *) instead of max(Delay): keeps the full row at the
//      moment of maximum delay, so downstream automation gets the event
//      context without a second lookup query.
// Source: BusTelemetry (Eventhouse: DetectiveAgency, live Eventstream)

BusTelemetry
| where Timestamp > ago(2h)
| extend Delay = Timestamp - ScheduleTime
| summarize arg_max(Delay, *) by BusLine
| where Delay > 30m
| top 5 by Delay desc
